### =====================================================================
### Pruebas BH-API en SandboxBHv2 (BC 28.4)
### Requiere la extensión "REST Client" de VS Code (humao.rest-client)
###
### 1) Obtener token (PowerShell):
###    az account get-access-token --resource https://api.businesscentral.dynamics.com --query accessToken -o tsv
###    y pegarlo en @token (dura ~1 hora)
### 2) Ejecutar "GET companies" y copiar el id de la compañía a @companyId
### 3) Ejecutar cada request con "Send Request" y anotar el resultado en la tabla del final
### =====================================================================

@tenant = 10657a47-53a7-4493-b90b-033cc0505242
@env = SandboxBHv2
@token = PEGAR_TOKEN_AQUI
@companyId = PEGAR_COMPANY_ID_AQUI

@base = https://api.businesscentral.dynamics.com/v2.0/{{tenant}}/{{env}}/api/bh/bh/beta
@co = {{base}}/companies({{companyId}})

### 0. Compañías (sirve para validar token y que la extensión esté publicada)
GET {{base}}/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### LECTURA — un registro por endpoint (debe responder 200 y campos poblados)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### 60103 Vendors
GET {{co}}/vendors?$top=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 60104 Sales Invoice Lines
GET {{co}}/salesInvoiceLines?$top=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 60105 Sales Invoices
GET {{co}}/salesInvoices?$top=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 60106 Productos (campo Origen vía RecordRef 80702)
GET {{co}}/productos?$top=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 60107 BOM Components
GET {{co}}/bomComponents?$top=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 60108 Opportunities
GET {{co}}/opportunities?$top=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 60109 Sales Quotes
GET {{co}}/salesQuotes?$top=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 60110 Sales Orders
GET {{co}}/salesOrders?$top=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 60111 Customers
GET {{co}}/customers?$top=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 60112 Salespersons
GET {{co}}/salespersonPurchasers?$top=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 60113 Payment Journal Lines
GET {{co}}/paymentJournalLines?$top=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 60114 Project Lines
GET {{co}}/projectLines?$top=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 60115 Purchase Invoices (buffer temporal: borradores + contabilizadas)
GET {{co}}/purchaseInvoices?$top=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 60116 No. Series Lines
GET {{co}}/noSeriesLines?$top=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 60117 Purchase Invoice Lines (solo borradores)
GET {{co}}/purchaseInvoiceLines?$top=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 60118 Budget Amounts (agregado; solo lectura). Cambiar el nombre del presupuesto
GET {{co}}/budgetAmounts?$filter=budgetName eq '2026'
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 60119 Multiplicadores LP (depende de LyLVariantsExt)
GET {{co}}/multiplicadoresLP?$top=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 60120 Origenes LP (incluye totalFob calculado; probar con un documento real)
GET {{co}}/origenesLP?$filter=orderNo eq 'C03980'
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 60122 Projects
GET {{co}}/projects?$top=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### ESCRITURA — usar datos de prueba; reemplazar ids/valores
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### Vendors: POST de prueba (ajustar campos a tu esquema)
# POST {{co}}/vendors
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# { "displayName": "ZZ PRUEBA V28.4" }

### Projects: acción bound copyProjectTasks (reemplazar ids)
# POST {{co}}/projects(ID_PROYECTO_DESTINO)/Microsoft.NAV.copyProjectTasks
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# { "sourceProjectNo": "PXXXX", "copyPlanningLines": false, "copyQuantity": false, "copyDimensions": true }

### Purchase Invoices: PATCH sobre factura contabilizada debe fallar con Error() (esperado)
# PATCH {{co}}/purchaseInvoices(ID_CONTABILIZADA)
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
# If-Match: *
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# { "vendorInvoiceNumber": "X" }

